>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `CS_FASTFORCE_TAC`

``` hol4
clasimpLib.CS_FASTFORCE_TAC :
  clasetLib.claset -> simpLib.simpset -> tactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Constructs the context-explicit form of `FASTFORCE_TAC`.

`CS_FASTFORCE_TAC cs ss` runs depth-first classical search with
assumption-aware full simplification from `ss` installed as an unsafe
wrapper on `cs`. It reads no global clasimp context and processes no
theorem list.

### Failure

Fails unless search closes the goal. Unbounded depth-first search can
diverge.

### Example

``` hol4
val fastforce =
  clasimpLib.CS_FASTFORCE_TAC
    (clasetLib.the_claset ()) (clasimpLib.clasimp_ss ());
```

### See also

[`clasimpLib.FASTFORCE_TAC`](#clasimpLib.FASTFORCE_TAC),
[`clasimpLib.add_simp_wrapper`](#clasimpLib.add_simp_wrapper),
[`classicalLib.CS_FAST_TAC`](#classicalLib.CS_FAST_TAC)
